{"task_id": "HumanEval/3", "solution": "from typing import List\n\nclass Account:\n    \"\"\"Manages an account balance with update and below-zero check functionalities.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._balance = 0\n\n    def update_balance(self, amount: int):\n        \"\"\"Updates the account balance by the given amount.\"\"\"\n        self._balance += amount\n\n    def is_below_zero(self) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if the account balance is currently below zero.\"\"\"\n        return self._balance < 0\n\n\ndef below_zero(operations: List[int]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Detects if an account balance, starting at zero, ever falls below zero after a sequence of operations.\"\"\"\n    account = Account()\n    for op in operations:\n        account.update_balance(op)\n        if account.is_below_zero():\n            return True\n    return False"}
