{"task_id": "HumanEval/46", "solution": "def fib4(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th element of the Fib4 sequence iteratively using dynamic programming.\n    The sequence is defined by fib4(0)=0, fib4(1)=0, fib4(2)=2, fib4(3)=0, and fib4(n) = fib4(n-1) + fib4(n-2) + fib4(n-3) + fib4(n-4) for n > 3.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 2:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 3:\n        return 0\n\n    # Initialize the dynamic programming array with the base cases\n    fib_array = [0, 0, 2, 0]\n\n    # Iteratively compute values from fib4(4) up to fib4(n)\n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        next_fib = fib_array[i-1] + fib_array[i-2] + fib_array[i-3] + fib_array[i-4]\n        fib_array.append(next_fib)\n\n    return fib_array[n]"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/46", "solution": "```python\ndef fib4(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th element of the fib4 number sequence iteratively.\n    It uses dynamic programming to store previously computed values for efficiency.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 2:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 3:\n        return 0\n\n    # Initialize cache with base cases\n    fib_cache = [0] * (n + 1)\n    fib_cache[0] = 0\n    fib_cache[1] = 0\n    fib_cache[2] = 2\n    fib_cache[3] = 0\n\n    # Iteratively calculate fib4(i) for i from 4 to n\n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        fib_cache[i] = fib_cache[i-1] + fib_cache[i-2] + fib_cache[i-3] + fib_cache[i-4]\n\n    return fib_cache[n]\n```"}
