{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "```python\n_fibfib_cache = {}\n\ndef fibfib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th element of the FibFib number sequence using memoization.\n    It adheres to fibfib(0)=0, fibfib(1)=0, fibfib(2)=1, and fibfib(n) = fibfib(n-1) + fibfib(n-2) + fibfib(n-3).\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _fibfib_cache:\n        return _fibfib_cache[n]\n\n    if n == 0:\n        result = 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        result = 0\n    elif n == 2:\n        result = 1\n    else: # n > 2\n        result = fibfib(n - 1) + fibfib(n - 2) + fibfib(n - 3)\n\n    _fibfib_cache[n] = result\n    return result\n```"}
