{"task_id": "HumanEval/64", "solution": "def vowels_count(s):\n    \"\"\"Write a function vowels_count which takes a string representing\n    a word as input and returns the number of vowels in the string.\n    Vowels in this case are 'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'. Here, 'y' is also a\n    vowel, but only when it is at the end of the given word.\n\n    Example:\n    >>> vowels_count(\"abcde\")\n    2\n    >>> vowels_count(\"ACEDY\")\n    3\n    >>> vowels_count(\"hello\")\n    2\n    >>> vowels_count(\"rhythm\")\n    0\n    >>> vowels_count(\"apply\")\n    2\n    >>> vowels_count(\"aeiouAEIOU\")\n    10\n    >>> vowels_count(\"\")\n    0\n    >>> vowels_count(\"bcdfgh\")\n    0\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    standard_vowels = {'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'}\n    n = len(s)\n\n    for i, char in enumerate(s):\n        char_lower = char.lower()\n\n        if char_lower in standard_vowels:\n            count += 1\n        elif char_lower == 'y' and i == n - 1:\n            count += 1\n\n    return count"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "```python\n_memo = {}\n\ndef fibfib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th element of the FibFib sequence using memoization.\n    It utilizes a module-level dictionary to store previously computed values for efficiency.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 1\n\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    result = fibfib(n - 1) + fibfib(n - 2) + fibfib(n - 3)\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/64", "solution": "```python\ndef vowels_count(s):\n    \"\"\"This function counts vowels ('a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u') in a string, case-insensitively.\n    'y' is counted only if it's the last character of the word.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    s_lower = s.lower()\n    standard_vowels = {'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'}\n\n    for char in s_lower:\n        if char in standard_vowels:\n            count += 1\n\n    if s and s_lower[-1] == 'y':\n        count += 1\n\n    return count\n```"}
