ermediate_planets)"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/150", "solution": "```python\ndef x_or_y(n, x, y):\n    \"\"\"A simple program which should return the value of x if n is\n    a prime number and should return the value of y otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def is_prime(num):\n        \"\"\"Determines if an integer num is a prime number.\"\"\"\n        if num < 2:\n            return False\n        for i in range(2, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    if is_prime(n):\n        return x\n    else:\n        return y\n```"}
